    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring classic RPG-style exploration and turn-based battles, Contract &amp; Control lets you recruit a ton of different characters to customize with weaponry, armor and skills, and to take on all kinds of animal enemies... And make them your allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in overland battles, delve into dungeons or raids to level up your characters and recruit new animal themed members to your team!  <br><br>This release features day / night cycles, in-game weather system, and a bunch of other cool things you'll have to see for yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*We take no responsibility if any mind harm comes your way thanks to playing this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring classic RPG-style exploration and turn-based battles, Contract &amp; Control lets you recruit a ton of different characters to customize with weaponry, armor and skills, and to take on all kinds of animal enemies... And make them your allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in overland battles, delve into dungeons or raids to level up your characters and recruit new animal themed members to your team!  <br><br>This release features day / night cycles, in-game weather system, and a bunch of other cool things you'll have to see for yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*We take no responsibility if any mind harm comes your way thanks to playing this game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Jump into a uniquely wild RPG where your crew isn\u2019t made of animals - but people named after them! Build your squad with awesome characters each rocking their own style. Level them up, gear them out, and contract them all like your life depends on it. Chase the thrill of the collector\u2019s dream!",
